{"title":"Career Roadmap · UI/UX Designer","role":"UI/UX Designer","summary":"A UI/UX Designer researches user needs and designs intuitive, accessible, visually consistent digital experiences for websites, mobile apps, software products, and emerging interfaces.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Multimedia & Animation / UI-UX"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA UI/UX","Design Internship","Junior UI/UX Designer","Product Designer","Senior Product Designer","Design Lead / UX Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Industry Direction","What the Designer Should Build"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Product-led digital experiences"},{"text":"UI design, UX research, Figma, design systems"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"AI-assisted product design"},{"text":"AI prototyping, design automation, usability analytics"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Multimodal interfaces"},{"text":"Voice, conversational UI, adaptive interfaces"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Spatial and intelligent interfaces"},{"text":"AR/VR, 3D, contextual experiences"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Adaptive digital products"},{"text":"Personalised interfaces and AI-native UX"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Autonomous interface generation"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction and experience architecture"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Typography, colour, layout, composition"},{"text":"UI redesign portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"UX fundamentals"},{"text":"Research, personas, user journeys, wireframes"},{"text":"UX case study"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Product design"},{"text":"F